TEXT 0 2016 Left 2 ;C1_base_reconstruction, testbench C_ac
TEXT 0 2056 Left 2 ;Nets are joined by their labels (same name = same net). Open in LTspice and press Run.
TEXT 0 2096 Left 2 ;Open loop (RF = 1 GOhm, CF = 10 F set the DC point, inputs at 0.3 V). Phase margin = 180 + phase of v_at_ugf.
TEXT 0 2136 Left 2 !.include ptm90.lib
TEXT 0 2176 Left 2 !.ac dec 40 0.1 100Meg
TEXT 0 2216 Left 2 !.meas AC a0 FIND mag(V(out)) AT=1
TEXT 0 2256 Left 2 !.meas AC ugf WHEN mag(V(out))=1
TEXT 0 2296 Left 2 !.meas AC v_at_ugf FIND V(out) AT=ugf
